# A project saved by X0X 1.3, before PC IN CH and the PC MAP (tests/fixtures/v13_store.bin, made in 1.3's
# simulator: the 909's kick on the quarters in P1 and on step 1 in P2, 120 BPM, the song P1 P2, MIX MIDI
# CH 5) loads as it was, with PC IN CH OFF and an empty map (none after its stream). Saved again, the stream
# keeps 1.3's raw length, so 1.3 still loads it, and the map follows it.
wait 100
storeload tests/fixtures/v13_store.bin
reboot
wait 300
expect pattern 1
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect hit0.0.4 1
expect tempo 120
expect songlen 2
expect songbar2.0 2
expect mixchset 5
expect pcch 0
expect pcmapped 0
midi C9 70 00
wait 100
expect pattern 1
# saved again (a PC mapped first, so only the map after the stream can bring it back), it loads the same
tap GLO
turn SELECT 9
turn ALGO 10
expect pcch 10
midi C9 70 00
wait 100
turn SELECT 2
spin ALGO 2
expect pcmap112 2
tap HOME
tap SAVE
wait 1500
reboot
wait 300
expect pattern 1
expect hit0.0.4 1
expect songlen 2
expect songbar2.0 2
expect mixchset 5
expect tempo 120
expect pcch 10
expect pcmap112 2
expect pcmapped 1
expect rawlen 29572
# a damaged map (its CRC fails) loads empty; the project and the settings are as they were
pctdamage
reboot
wait 300
expect pcmapped 0
expect pcch 10
expect hit0.0.4 1
expect songlen 2
